  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This portfolio supports The Gambia&#x2019;s transition from a fragmented, informal, and climate vulnerable economy to an inclusive, diversified, and climate resilient system. It drives three major shifts: upgrading low productivity livelihoods into competitive, climate smart value chains; strengthening weak, siloed institutions into coordinated, accountable governance systems; and transforming climate exposed communities into resilient, adaptive local economies. By connecting local innovation with nati</narrative>
  </description>
